        "collapsible_tab_6H7MGK": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Description",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Most “lumbar supports” just prop you up. LumbarEase™ retrains you. </p><p>Built around a contoured lumbar backrest, LumbarEase™ gently guides your spine back into proper alignment — the thing that turns slouching by hour three into sitting upright without thinking about it. It’s not a temporary fix you<br/>have to consciously hold; it works with your body the whole time you’re seated.</p><p><strong>What's included:</strong></p><p>● LumbarEase™ Backrest — contoured lower back support, memory foam, breathable air-flow mesh, adjustable dual straps and removable washable zip cover</p><p>● The SitComfort 7-Day Reset Program (guided)</p><p>• Backed by a 30-day money-back guarantee</p><p><em>Designed in Australia for people who sit 6+ hours a day and are done compromising on comfort.</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X3EF6V": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "7-Day Reset Program",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>It's the difference between a cushion that feels good for a day and a system that fixes how you sit for good.</p><p>The 7-Day Reset Program is a guided, day-by-day plan included free with every ComfortBundle™. Each day takes a few minutes and builds on the last — small posture cues, stretches, and setup adjustments that retrain your body to sit better, not just softer.</p><p><strong>How it works:</strong></p><p>● Day-by-day guidance delivered straight to your inbox — no app, no login, no fuss</p><p>● Simple, physio-informed movements and posture checks you can do at your desk</p><p>● Built to work alongside your ErgoRelief™ and LumbarEase™ set-up</p><p>● Takes 2–3 minutes a day</p><p>By Day 7, you're not just sitting on a better cushion — you're sitting better, period. That's the difference between temporary relief and a lasting fix.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_PjfFQm": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
